- [Softstack article on the HAL Privatbank blockchain securities register audit](https://softstack.io/blog/hal-bank-launches-blockchain-securities-register-audited-by-softstack/)

## Why This Engagement Matters

This is a strong public reference because it relates to regulated financial market infrastructure rather than a typical crypto-native application.

This is especially relevant for:
- blockchain securities register security
- tokenized securities infrastructure
- eWpG-related blockchain systems
- regulated financial market blockchain applications

## Engagement Scope

HAL Privatbank launched a blockchain securities register and **Softstack was selected as smart contract auditor** for this tokenized securities infrastructure.

Public articles frame the work around the secure launch of the blockchain-based register and the smart contract layer supporting the infrastructure.


## Summary

This folder highlights Softstack’s publicly documented blockchain security work for **HAL Privatbank** in connection with blockchain-based securities register infrastructure.

It is a strong reference for Softstack’s involvement in **regulated tokenization systems**, **blockchain register infrastructure**, and **security-critical financial market implementations under the eWpG framework**.
